\pard\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\kerning1\f0\fs32\lang1033 RainMachine Driver\f1\fs24\par
\f0\fs20\par
\par
\ul\f1\fs28 Settings\fs24\par
\ulnone\par
\b Model\b0 : RainMachine device model\par
\par
\b IP Address\b0 : Hostname or IP address of RainMachine device\par
\par
\b Port\b0 : HTTPS API port of RainMachine device \i (default: 8080)\par
\i0\par
\b Program Count\b0 : Number of programs configured on RainMachine device \i (default: 3)\par
\i0\par
\b Zone Count\b0 : Number of zones used on RainMachine device \i (default: 8, max: 16)\par
\i0\par
\b Password\b0 : RainMachine device password, used for API access\par
\par
\b Enable Polling\b0 : Allows driver to poll RainMachine device for status automatically; if disabled, data will only be updated when Refresh is called \i (default: true)\par
\i0\par
\b Polling Interval\b0 : Seconds between data polling events \i (default: 60, only shown when Enable Polling is true)\par
\i0\par
\b Enable Trace\b0 : Enables verbose debug logging to the RTI controller log \i (hidden debug setting, default: false)\par
\i0\par
\par
\ul\fs28 Events\fs24\par
\ulnone\par
\b Refresh All Data\b0 : Requests updated programs, zones, and restrictions from the device\par
\par
\b Select Program From List\b0  (Index): Sets the selected program to the item at the given zero-based list index; updates all Selected Program variables\par
\par
\b Select Zone From List\b0  (Index): Sets the selected zone to the item at the given zero-based list index; updates all Selected Zone variables\par
\par
\b Start Program\b0  (Program): Starts the specified program by number (1 through Program Count)\par
\par
\b Stop Program\b0  (Program): Stops the specified program by number (1 through Program Count)\par
\par
\b Start Selected Program\b0 : Starts the currently selected program\par
\par
\b Stop Selected Program\b0 : Stops the currently selected program\par
\par
\b Start Zone\b0  (Zone, Seconds): Starts the specified zone for the given duration in seconds\par
\par
\b Stop Zone\b0  (Zone): Stops the specified zone\par
\par
\b Start Selected Zone\b0  (Seconds): Starts the currently selected zone for the given duration in seconds\par
\par
\b Stop Selected Zone\b0 : Stops the currently selected zone\par
\par
\par
\ul\fs28 Variables\fs24\par
\ulnone\par
Variables are updated automatically when polling fires or after any command that changes device state. All variable names are case-sensitive.\par
\par
\b\fs22 Current Restrictions\b0\fs20\par
\par
\b CurrentRestrictionHourly\b0  (boolean): Hourly watering restriction is active\par
\b CurrentRestrictionFreeze\b0  (boolean): Freeze protection restriction is active\par
\b CurrentRestrictionMonth\b0  (boolean): Monthly restriction is active\par
\b CurrentRestrictionWeekDay\b0  (boolean): Weekday restriction is active\par
\b CurrentRestrictionRainDelay\b0  (boolean): Rain delay restriction is active\par
\b CurrentRestrictionRainDelayCounter\b0  (integer): Remaining rain delay in seconds\par
\b CurrentRestrictionRainSensor\b0  (boolean): Rain sensor restriction is active\par
\b CurrentRestrictionLastLeakDetected\b0  (integer): Unix timestamp of last leak detection event\par
\par
\b\fs22 Programs\b0\fs20\par
\par
\b ProgramList\b0  (list): Program names, populated up to Program Count entries\par
\b RunningProgramName\b0  (string): Name of the currently running program; empty string if none\par
\b RunningProgramStartTime\b0  (string): Start time of the currently running program\par
\par
The following variables are written for each program, where \{N\} is the program number (1 through Program Count):\par
\par
\b Program\{N\}Uid\b0  (integer): Unique identifier\par
\b Program\{N\}Name\b0  (string)\par
\b Program\{N\}Active\b0  (boolean): Whether the program is enabled\par
\b Program\{N\}Status\b0  (integer): 0 = Not Running, 1 = Running, 2 = Queued\par
\b Program\{N\}StartTime\b0  (string)\par
\b Program\{N\}StartTimeParams\b0  (string): Formatted start time offset, e.g. \ldblquote 10m After Sunrise\rdblquote\par
\b Program\{N\}NextRun\b0  (string): ISO date of next scheduled run, e.g. \ldblquote 2021-07-25\rdblquote ; empty if none\par
\b Program\{N\}StartDate\b0  (string): ISO date the program becomes active\par
\b Program\{N\}EndDate\b0  (string): ISO date the program expires\par
\b Program\{N\}YearlyRecurring\b0  (boolean)\par
\b Program\{N\}FrequencyType\b0  (integer): 0 = Daily, 1 = Every N Days, 2 = Weekdays, 4 = Odd/Even Day\par
\b Program\{N\}FrequencyParam\b0  (string): Frequency parameter value\par
\b Program\{N\}FreqModified\b0  (integer): Weather-based adjustment percentage (0\endash 100)\par
\b Program\{N\}Cycles\b0  (integer): Number of cycles\par
\b Program\{N\}Soak\b0  (integer): Soak time between cycles in seconds\par
\b Program\{N\}CsOn\b0  (boolean): Cycle and soak enabled\par
\b Program\{N\}Delay\b0  (integer): Pre-run delay in seconds\par
\b Program\{N\}DelayOn\b0  (boolean): Pre-run delay enabled\par
\b Program\{N\}IgnoreInternetWeather\b0  (boolean)\par
\b Program\{N\}UseWaterSense\b0  (boolean)\par
\b Program\{N\}FutureField1\b0  (integer): Forecasted rain amount\par
\b Program\{N\}SimulationExpired\b0  (boolean)\par
\par
Per-zone watering times within each program, where \{Z\} is the zone ID:\par
\par
\b Program\{N\}Zone\{Z\}Id\b0  (integer), \b Program\{N\}Zone\{Z\}Name\b0  (string), \b Program\{N\}Zone\{Z\}Order\b0  (integer), \b Program\{N\}Zone\{Z\}Duration\b0  (integer, seconds), \b Program\{N\}Zone\{Z\}Active\b0  (boolean), \b Program\{N\}Zone\{Z\}UserPercentage\b0  (string), \b Program\{N\}Zone\{Z\}MinRuntimeCoef\b0  (integer)\par
\par
\b\fs22 Zones\b0\fs20\par
\par
\b ZoneList\b0  (list): Zone names, populated up to Zone Count entries\par
\b RunningZoneName\b0  (string): Name of the currently running zone; empty string if none\par
\b RunningZoneRemaining\b0  (integer): Remaining run time of the running zone in seconds\par
\par
The following variables are written for each zone, where \{N\} is the zone number (1 through Zone Count):\par
\par
\b Zone\{N\}Name\b0  (string)\par
\b Zone\{N\}Active\b0  (boolean): Whether the zone is enabled\par
\b Zone\{N\}State\b0  (integer): 0 = Not Running, 1 = Running, 2 = Queued\par
\b Zone\{N\}Remaining\b0  (integer): Remaining run time in seconds\par
\b Zone\{N\}MachineDuration\b0  (integer): Scheduled duration in seconds\par
\b Zone\{N\}UserDuration\b0  (integer): User-configured duration in seconds\par
\b Zone\{N\}Cycle\b0  (integer): Current cycle number\par
\b Zone\{N\}NumberOfCycles\b0  (integer): Total number of cycles\par
\b Zone\{N\}Restriction\b0  (boolean): Zone is currently restricted\par
\par
\b\fs22 Selected Program\b0\fs20\par
\par
Updated by the \b Select Program From List\b0  event and after each state refresh. Mirrors the Program\{N\} variables for the currently selected program:\par
\par
\b SelectedProgramUid\b0 , \b SelectedProgramName\b0 , \b SelectedProgramActive\b0 , \b SelectedProgramStatus\b0 , \b SelectedProgramStartTime\b0 , \b SelectedProgramStartTimeParams\b0 , \b SelectedProgramNextRun\b0 , \b SelectedProgramStartDate\b0 , \b SelectedProgramEndDate\b0 , \b SelectedProgramYearlyRecurring\b0 , \b SelectedProgramFrequencyType\b0 , \b SelectedProgramFrequencyParam\b0 , \b SelectedProgramFreqModified\b0 , \b SelectedProgramCycles\b0 , \b SelectedProgramSoak\b0 , \b SelectedProgramCsOn\b0 , \b SelectedProgramDelay\b0 , \b SelectedProgramDelayOn\b0 , \b SelectedProgramIgnoreInternetWeather\b0 , \b SelectedProgramUseWaterSense\b0 , \b SelectedProgramFutureField1\b0 , \b SelectedProgramSimulationExpired\b0\par
\par
Per-zone watering times for the selected program, where \{N\} is 1 through Zone Count:\par
\par
\b SelectedProgramZone\{N\}Id\b0 , \b SelectedProgramZone\{N\}Name\b0 , \b SelectedProgramZone\{N\}Order\b0 , \b SelectedProgramZone\{N\}Duration\b0 , \b SelectedProgramZone\{N\}Active\b0 , \b SelectedProgramZone\{N\}UserPercentage\b0 , \b SelectedProgramZone\{N\}MinRuntimeCoef\b0\par
\par
\b\fs22 Selected Zone\b0\fs20\par
\par
Updated by the \b Select Zone From List\b0  event and after each state refresh. Mirrors the Zone\{N\} variables for the currently selected zone:\par
\par
\b SelectedZoneName\b0 , \b SelectedZoneActive\b0 , \b SelectedZoneState\b0 , \b SelectedZoneRemaining\b0 , \b SelectedZoneMachineDuration\b0 , \b SelectedZoneUserDuration\b0 , \b SelectedZoneCycle\b0 , \b SelectedZoneNumberOfCycles\b0 , \b SelectedZoneRestriction\b0\par
\par
\par
\ul\fs28 Changelog\fs24\par
\ulnone\par
\b v1.0\b0 : Initial Release\par
\par
\b v1.2\b0 : Driver made free / open-source\par
\par
\b v1.3\b0 : Fixed several bugs including incorrect program count config key, polling interval unit conversion, per-program zone variable indexing, and erroneous zone running state logic; removed unused code; updated SDK dependencies\par
